          "worked": "$A'=\\{b,d,f\\}$ and $B'=\\{a,f\\}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}A'\\cap B'&=\\{b,d,f\\}\\cap\\{a,f\\}\\\\A'\\cap B'&=\\{f\\}.\\end{align*}$$",
